flowchart TB
    Admin[Administrator or CI] -->|AWS API| AWS[AWS management plane]
    Admin -->|kubectl HTTPS 443| API[Kubernetes API server]
    AWS --> EKS[EKS service]
    EKS --> API
    API <--> ETCD[(etcd)]
    Scheduler[Scheduler] --> API
    Controllers[Controller managers] --> API
    API --> Kubelet[Kubelet]
    Karpenter[Managed Karpenter] --> API
    Karpenter --> EC2[EC2 capacity]
    EC2 --> Node[Auto Mode Bottlerocket node]
    Node --> Kubelet --> Pod[Application Pod]
    User[Application user] --> ELB[ALB or NLB] --> Pod
    Pod --> Storage[EBS or AWS data service]
